# `@eden-ecommerce/design`

Props only — no fetch, env, Sanity, Algolia, `next/image`. Source lives in `eden-ecommerce/design`. Studio consumes the published GitHub Packages tarball.

Studio pins **exact semver** (not `workspace:*`). Unpublished HMR: **yalc**. Gate: `pnpm check:design-release`. See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` § Shared-package strategy.

This repo must **not** depend on `@eden-ecommerce/common`.

## Folder layout

Each component is `{Name}/{Name}.tsx` + `{Name}.stories.tsx`. Deep import:

```ts
import { Button } from '@eden-ecommerce/design/primitives/actions/Button/Button';
import { EdenHeader } from '@eden-ecommerce/design/eden/header/EdenHeader/EdenHeader';
```

## Layers

`utilities` / `themes` / `styles` — foundational.
`primitives` — utilities/themes/styles only; **no cross-primitive family imports** (same-folder `_radix` / `_shadcn` colocation OK).
`fields` / `layout` / `renderers` — primitives + utilities/themes.
`blocks` — primitives, fields, layout, utilities, themes, **and other blocks**.
`eden` / `merchandise` / `panels` — primitives, fields, layout, blocks, renderers, utilities, themes.

`'use client'` files live under `{role}/client/` and take a `Client` suffix.

## Stories / loading / error

Stories always colocate in the component folder. Storybook host is in the `eden-ecommerce/design` repo.

Every `'use client'` component **must** have `{Name}.loading.tsx` + `{Name}.error.tsx` (stories may include Loading/Error). RSC must **not**. Studio wrappers follow the same law for design surfaces.

## Loaders — not in design

`imageLoader` / `videoLoader` / `mapLoader` / `markdownLoader` / `mermaidLoader` live in `@eden-ecommerce/lib`. Design takes slots (`imageSlot`, `media`).

## Deep imports — no barrels

No package-root import. See `no-barrels.mdc`. Gate in the design repo: `pnpm --filter @eden-ecommerce/design check:conventions`.
